Package: rbcc
Type: Package
Title: Risk-Based Control Charts
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Aamir", family = "Saghir", role = "aut"),
    person(given = c("Attila", "Imre"), family = "Katona", role = "aut"),
    person(given = c("Zsolt", "Tibor"), family = "Kosztyan",
           email = "kosztyan.zsolt@gtk.uni-pannon.hu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements univariate and multivariate risk-based control
    charts for statistical process control in the presence of measurement
    uncertainty. Available charts include Shewhart X-bar, R, and S charts,
    moving-average charts, exponentially weighted moving-average charts,
    cumulative-sum charts, and Hotelling T-squared charts. Chart parameters
    can be optimized by minimizing the total cost of the four decision
    outcomes. The methodology is described by Kosztyan and Katona (2016)
    <doi:10.1016/j.eswa.2016.06.019>, Kosztyan and Katona (2018)
    <doi:10.1016/j.cie.2018.04.052>, Katona et al. (2023)
    <doi:10.1109/ACCESS.2023.3312226>, Saghir et al. (2025)
    <doi:10.1016/j.rineng.2025.107278>, and Saghir et al. (2026)
    <doi:10.1016/j.rico.2026.100661>.
